  <description>
    <p>Installs, updates and starts LiquidBounce, a free and open-source Minecraft hacked client, together with Minecraft, the mod loader, Java and your mods.</p>
    <p>Sign in with a Microsoft account or play offline. The game and its dependencies are downloaded at runtime.</p>
  </description>
